{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/d76cb9160d659f5a96687b324584bad2.avif?t=1772819398\" width=1197 height=395 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a fanfiction writer who gets kidnapped by aliens. But instead of being probed or experimented upon you are taken to a space station run by a mysterious rich backer who selects a single member of each known intelligent alien species to write more for them to read. You are the only human on a writer's retreat space station filled with different alien species. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/814e1905eba0d4d2d462cd700a07c245.poster.avif?t=1772819398\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/814e1905eba0d4d2d462cd700a07c245.webm?t=1772819398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/814e1905eba0d4d2d462cd700a07c245.mp4?t=1772819398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Galactic Love Utopia</i> you will meet and get to know a bunch of intergalactic babes as you try to get used to living in this luxurious yet strange environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/0fe58a2c7383f5daec671fd106c406cb.poster.avif?t=1772819398\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/0fe58a2c7383f5daec671fd106c406cb.webm?t=1772819398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/0fe58a2c7383f5daec671fd106c406cb.mp4?t=1772819398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/8a85b0e85b786501dff04bc8acf35ef1.avif?t=1772819398\" width=1197 height=395 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galactic Love Utopia is a story focused visual novel with some dating simulator elements. Make choices and decide which part of the space station you want to explore by selecting a room to visit on the interactive map. Focus on improving your relationship with one or some of the main heroines, or visit a place where none of them tend to hang out for a scene with one of the side heroines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/8635016c4addcd7406db9e7ea5b720ee.poster.avif?t=1772819398\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/8635016c4addcd7406db9e7ea5b720ee.webm?t=1772819398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/8635016c4addcd7406db9e7ea5b720ee.mp4?t=1772819398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870550/extras/295656211effaff3f97fd7af25559cb5.avif?t=1772819398\" width=1197 height=395 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 story acts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 main heroines to romance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 side heroines you can have a one-night stand with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose whether you w